      "id": "A1", "kind": "literature", "name": "paper-laccase-btb-2026.md", "topicId": "TP1", "bytes": 0, "hash": "fixture", "createdAt": "2026-11-24T10:00:00Z",
      "text": "# Individual and Cooperative Photochemical–Enzymatic Processes for the Degradation of the Dye Bromothymol Blue: Kinetic and Eco-Toxicity Analysis\n\n来源：Europe PMC PMC13566542 · DOI 10.3390/ijms27177767 · International Journal of Molecular Sciences (2026) · 许可：CC BY 4.0\n\nIndividual and Cooperative Photochemical–Enzymatic Processes for the Degradation of the Dye Bromothymol Blue\n\n[摘要] The degradation of bromothymol blue (BTB) in aqueous solution was investigated through individual and sequential photochemical and enzymatic treatments. ... enzymatic degradation was favored at acidic pH, elevated temperature, and high amount of laccase, with optimal performance observed at pH 5 and 40 °C. Sequential treatments combining photochemical and enzymatic processes improved the overall removal efficiency, reaching degradation values above 70% regardless of the treatments order. ...\n\n## 3. Results and Discussion\n\n3.2 Enzymatic degradation of BTB\nEnzymatic degradation was favored at acidic pH, elevated temperature, and high amount of laccase, with optimal performance observed at pH 5 and 40 °C.\n\n3.3 Sequential treatments\nThe overall removal efficiency reached degradation values above 70% regardless of the treatments order."
    },
    {
      "id": "A2", "kind": "protocol", "name": "protocol-source.md", "topicId": "TP1", "bytes": 0, "hash": "fixture", "createdAt": "2026-11-24T10:00:00Z",
      "text": "# SLAC 实验设计与数据管理（原作者 notebook 节选）\n\n来源：Häußler, DaRUS DOI 10.18419/DARUS-3337，CC BY 4.0。\n\n- 研究对象：小型漆酶 SLAC 催化 ABTS 氧化为 ABTS 自由基；考察 pH 3–5.5、温度 25–45°C。\n- 实验设计：30 组动力学测定，初始 ABTS 浓度范围 0–200 µM；每个初始底物浓度有不加酶的对照。每种 pH/温度条件记录 ABTS 标准曲线与吸收光谱；以 340 nm 和 420 nm 同步跟踪底物消耗及产物生成，测量 15 分钟。\n- 处理路径：对照用于扣除酶和缓冲液吸收；各条件建立标准曲线，仅使用吸光度低于 3.2 的点；限定标准曲线范围内换算浓度以避免外推。"
    },
